  <NativeName>Madmax Zedmulator Extended</NativeName>
  <NativeDescription>Contains buildable props, buildings and possibly weapons to support survivor camps.

This used to be an unlisted release for compensation sudden deletions of my renewed models to the Towns and stuff way back. Since it feels very incomplete I was hesitant to release on public, while it still is incomplete I thought maybe this could be helpful for camps too.

This mod will be a breather while I work on Town and Stuff.

[h1]Buildings[/h1]
[b]Shelf[/b] (Model and capacity may be subject to change for revision)
A 2x1 Storage with 1600 lbs capacity

[b]Oven[/b] (Model and recipe subject to change)
Halves the rate of speed of cooking

[h1]Weapons:[/h1]
[b]Throwing rock[/b]
Made by breaking down flint into chunks 

[h1]Vanilla:[/h1]
[b]Portable Toilet[/b]
Built by assembling Portable Parts

Known issues:
[quote]
- Lag when oven is on fire
- Lack of sound for the oven on fire
[/quote]</NativeDescription>
